 file in Drive is always the latest."}],["$","div","2",{"className":"p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 text-gray-800 leading-relaxed bg-blue-50 border-blue-400","children":[false,"Module 2 covered sharing and access levels, and Module 3 covered comments, suggestions, and version history in Google Docs. This lesson uses the same tools in Sheets and Slides, the way a team uses them day to day."]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6","children":"Comments and action items"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","ul","0",{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary-500","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Select a cell (Sheets), or an object or slide (Slides), then select Insert › Comment or press Ctrl+Alt+M. Type and select Comment."}],["$","li","1",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"A cell with a comment shows a small mark in its corner. Select the cell to read the comment and reply."}],["$","li","2",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"To assign an action item, type @ and the person's name in the comment, check Assign to, and select Assign. They get an email, and they select Done on the comment when the task is finished."}],["$","li","3",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"When a comment is handled, select Resolve (the check mark in the top corner of the comment) to close it. Closed comments are listed under Comments at the top of the window, and Re-open brings one back."}],["$","li","4",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"People you mention need access to the file. Share it with them, or make sure it's already shared."}]]}],["$","$L1f","1",{"block":{"type":"drag-drop","mode":"order","title":"Assign the walkthrough to Kim","prompt":"Put the steps in order.","items":[{"id":"1","text":"Select cell E5, Marisol Vega's Walkthrough cell"},{"id":"2","text":"Insert › Comment (or Ctrl+Alt+M)"},{"id":"3","text":"Type @Kim and pick Kim Nguyen, then finish the comment"},{"id":"4","text":"Check Assign to Kim Nguyen"},{"id":"5","text":"Select Assign"}],"explanation":"The comment stays attached to the exact cell, and Kim gets an email about the action item."}}],"$L20"]}]]}],"$L21","$L22","$L23"]}]}]]}]
